<section class="hero" style="padding: 56px 0 64px;">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);">Resource Hub</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything in one place — crisis lines, education, self-care tools, and support. No more hunting across five different sites.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 40px 0 8px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <p>Plain answers to what caregivers ask us most — about caregiving, respite, and how Legacy's programs work.</p>
        <a class="more" href="faq.html">Read the FAQ →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Resource Directory</h3>
        <p>Trusted organizations serving dementia caregivers — crisis lines, county services, respite funding, and more.</p>
        <a class="more" href="directory.html">Browse the directory →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <input type="search" class="resource-search" id="resourceSearch" placeholder="Search resources… (try 'respite' or 'hotline')" aria-label="Search resources">
    <div class="filter-row" id="filterRow">
      <button class="filter-chip active" data-cat="all">All</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="crisis">Crisis Help</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="education">Education</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="selfcare">Self-Care</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="support">Support Groups</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" data-cat="financial">Financial &amp; Legal</button>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid" id="resourceGrid">
{%- for r in resources %}
      <div class="card resource-item" data-cat="{{ r.category }}">
        <span class="resource-tag">{{ r.category_label | e }}</span>
        <h3>{{ r.title | e }}</h3>
        <p>{{ r.description | e }}</p>
{%- if r.link == "#demo" %}
        <a class="more" href="#" onclick="alert('Demo resource link'); return false;">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- elif r.link == "#demo-grant" %}
        <a class="more" href="#" onclick="alert('Demo: your application status is tracked on your caregiver record — staff and you see the same journey.'); return false;">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- else %}
        <a class="more" href="{{ r.link }}">{{ r.link_label | e }}</a>
{%- endif %}
      </div>
{%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="small muted mt-24" id="noResults" style="display:none;">No resources match your search — try a different term.</p>
    <p class="small muted mt-24">Staff add or update resources by chat — <em>"add the new caregiver support hotline under Crisis Help"</em> — previewed and confirmed before going live.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="toolkit" style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Self-care</span><h2>Caregiver Wellness Toolkit</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">A curated kit of self-care practices, checklists, and wellness tools built for dementia caregivers.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="guides"><span class="eyebrow">Take-home</span><h2>Downloadable Guides</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Printable guides on caregiving topics — from first steps after a diagnosis to planning respite.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="blog"><span class="eyebrow">Stories</span><h2>Blog &amp; Stories</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Caregiver stories and Legacy updates will be published here. Meanwhile, hear <a href="about.html#voices">caregiver voices</a>.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

